{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete the following terms:\n\nsarcosine biosynthetic process GO:1901054 (2 EXP)\n1-aminocyclopropane-1-carboxylate biosynthetic process GO:0042218  - 3 EXP\ndiaminopimelate biosynthetic process GO:0019877  - 9 EXP\nbeta-alanine biosynthetic process via 3-ureidopropionate GO:0033396 - 3 EXP\n\nsee [Ontology ticket #31410](https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31510)\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1u5jEYix5iDi09Vi4nsglHQKDE10omIeou1OLU96QjZc/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nGO:0019877\nEcoCyc 3\nEcoliWiki  2 \n~MTBBASE  3~\n~UniProt  2~\n\nGO:0042218\nGOC 3\n\nGO:1901054\n~FlyBase  1 - DONE~\nRGD 1\n\nGO:0033396\nWB  1\nUniProt 2\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n[LIST IDs + ADD ASSIGNEES] \n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-02-17T19:28:19Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0019877, GO:0042218, GO:1901054, GO:0033396", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-02-26T13:34:32Z"}
